<mxCell id="c38" value="Findings from the last two game days: vCPU quota in us-west-2 was at the default; a TLS certificate existed only in us-east-1;&lt;br&gt;a nightly batch job ran in both Regions after failover and sent 3,100 duplicate emails. Each one is now a check in the plan." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#3C4043;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="812" width="1420" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
